Today is Tuesday.
It is evening, and I am coming back to my apartment from the gym.
Usually, I am tired after exercising.
Every day, I relax at night.
Usually, I sit on the sofa and read a book.
But tonight, I am not reading.
Today, I have a boring task.
Usually, people do not do such tasks quickly.
I too have avoided doing this task for many days.
Today, I am updating my electricity account details.
I pick up my mobile phone.
I sit on the chair and drink water.
I do not like such administrative work.
Even so, today it is necessary.
I open that website on the internet.
There is no relaxing tonight, only this task.
